{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 44, :comments ["<b>On the chambers:</b> Like לשכות. One says it this way and one says it that way." "<b>For the treasures:</b> Meaning 'to be treasures.'" "<b>The portions of the Torah:</b> And so אשר מינה את מאכלכם, and the alef in place of yod: מניות. And it does not change in construct state, and so במצדות עין גדי. Or the construct form is deficient, and so it is מנאות מנאות התורה, and so הארון, הארון הברית."], :book :nehemiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {2 "The syntax and examples in this comment are compressed and difficult to parse; rendered hyper-literally without smoothing."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Nehemiah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/nechemya"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:15:40.480057589Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}